WEBVTT

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.160
It's wonderful to be young, isn't it?

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:10.810
We've taken a look at your entire body, from head to toe.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:12.880
It's a fine-looking one, isn't it?

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.140
This old man's quite jealous.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.190
Now then, you'll permit me to move on to some questions.

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:23.950
Didn't you guide the Gilgamesh that day?

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:29.160
The wave you emitted inside the Turangalila...

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.750
How do you explain that?

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.130
Have you never attempted to join their group?

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.730
So then, have you had contact with Enkidu?

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.370
What is Enkidu's objective?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.380
What is your relationship with Enkidu?

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.280
I'll show you something interesting.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:57.490
This is your ID data, compiled when you first entered the Turangalila.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:03.360
And this is Dr. Terumichi Madoka's data, which was used at Heaven's Gate.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:07.700
What I'd like you to note are the DNA patterns for the two of you.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.200
Astonishingly, they form a perfect match.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.860
Such a thing cannot possibly be.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.570
What do you think this means?

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.010
What does it mean?

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.080
Everyone should have a good attorney.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.630
Be grateful to the widow.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.010
Please tell me. What does it mean?!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:09.850
Tatsuya!

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.190
Are you okay?

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:23.530
Tatsuya...

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.370
Is it true?

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.440
What might you be referring to?

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.170
That I'm my dad's...

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:02.510
That I'm Enkidu's clone. Is it true?

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:19.520
You knew! Why didn't you tell me?!

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.290
Because there was no need to.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.430
How can you say that? Shouldn't I have had a right to know?

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:30.530
What exactly do you think you could've done even if you had known?

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.870
Furthermore, this is something your mother did.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:38.750
Your mother didn't tell you either, did she?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:43.350
I don't really know what her intentions were in wanting to give birth to you,

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.420
...but if you must bear a grudge, bear one against your mother.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.060
Madoka!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.210
Wait!

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:05.770
There's no need to panic.

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:11.070
There's only one place that boy would go after all.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.450
<i>Hey, can clones be made easily?</i>

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:43.350
<i>She was saying it was something Tatsuya's mother did.</i>

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:46.480
<i>Relatively easily, if you have a cloned embryo.</i>

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:48.190
<i>A cloned embryo?</i>

00:06:48.190 --> 00:06:51.920
<i>If you give an electrical shock to an egg cell with a transferred nucleus,</i>

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.050
<i>...cell division begins and it becomes a cloned embryo.</i>

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:58.220
<i>You just put it back in the womb.</i>

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:00.760
<i>The rest is the same as usual.</i>

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:04.140
<i>It's born into this world through pregnancy and delivery.</i>

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:06.900
<i>Even you could easily make a clone, Fu.</i>

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.080
Oink!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.200
<i>Does that mean Tatsuya is exactly the same as Enkidu?</i>

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.980
<i>Madoka is Madoka. He's a different human being.</i>

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.320
<i>Even if his DNA is the same.</i>

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:25.150
<i>Yeah, he sure doesn't seem like he could do anything as outrageous as terrorism.</i>

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:33.360
<i>This may be an issue that impacts us too though, since we've got Dynamis just like Madoka.</i>

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:52.140
Long time no see. You look remarkably well.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.640
This is a seedy-looking room.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.010
You've stayed all this time in a place like this?

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:02.550
Let's go home. Everyone's waiting for your return.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:07.520
The Professor also wants to see you. And Mother too.

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.330
Mother?

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:13.890
The ones who died before us are now inside Mother,

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.870
...about to return to life, in the same way that we were born.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:21.740
That, too, is because the Professor gathered their souls to him.

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.630
Your being here is also because the Professor guided you, you know.

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:34.580
You succeeded in the destruction of the Turangalila, but our purpose hasn't been achieved yet.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.280
This planet's cleansing is yet to come.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.290
Nothing will begin without you, right?

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:49.730
The matter of this world is eating away at your body, you poor thing.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:51.230
Wait...

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:59.840
I'll release you from the yoke of matter.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.940
Welcome home.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.370
What are you doing?

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:33.180
Just what it looks like.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:35.180
You came to take him back, did you?

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.050
Thanks for your help until today.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:40.590
If so, then hurry up and get out! And take that person with you!

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:42.450
What are you angry about?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.490
I'm not angry, I'm telling you!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.860
Shhh, the poor thing's having sweet dreams,

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:49.860
...and you'll wake him up again!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:54.860
Have you ever seen his sleeping face so peaceful?

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:57.540
If it's him you're upset about, he's going to be fine now,

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:01.630
...since I've also mended the wounds for him that you could not.

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:08.240
You look as though you were hoping for something, but you are different from us.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.910
We can't live in the same world.

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.690
All right, let's go home.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.300
We keep running into each other today.

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.310
What are you doing here?

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.780
I'm here on a home visit.

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.820
Right now, she appears to be busy, so I'm maintaining a respectful distance,

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.850
...but there shouldn't be a problem with you going.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.890
This will be a good lesson about the world.

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:05.540
Kiyoko!

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:06.590
Tatsuya?!

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:09.600
You!

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.100
Don't, Tatsuya!

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.410
You've got it wrong! This is nothing.

00:12:15.780 --> 00:12:20.380
I understand that this displeases you, but I'm not here because I want to be.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:25.580
Your big sister took him into her bed and won't let him go, so I came to get him.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:32.430
Why do you stand against us too?

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:35.560
Why don't you comprehend what the Professor is attempting to do?

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.760
Rejecting the Professor's ideals... You're a copy of him, aren't you?

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.060
A copy?

00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:48.080
<i>Copy... copy... copy... copy... copy...</i>

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:07.800
Kiyoko...

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:28.780
This smoke... It can't be!

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:31.850
It is, Lapis Warka powder.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.590
Don't let them get free of the smoke, do you hear me?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.530
As for those two, capture them alive.

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.430
You two are cursed siblings.

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:53.440
Quick!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.390
You guys...

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:12.930
This way.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.070
A new member of Gilgamesh, is it?

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:36.980
You were late in coming.

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:39.050
Don't complain.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.660
There's no end to them.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.730
Within this smoke, our power...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:53.860
I know that. Besides, I'm not the only one who's here.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.380
Now we can use our Dynamis freely.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.250
So fresh Gilgamesh fighters are putting in an appearance, eh?

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.890
Don't flinch! Proceed with the attack!

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.350
Annihilate the targets!

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:30.800
How did you all know I'd be here?

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:35.910
There's no place you'd go but to your sister, right, Madoka?

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:37.980
Nice to see you again.

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:41.750
Sure...

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:43.890
Is your eye okay?

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:44.980
Yes...

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:49.590
It's like being in an air-raid shelter.

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.360
There's no need for us to go waltzing out there and get mixed up in this.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:04.830
It's rough sitting tight here too. Fu, sing something.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:08.680
A song? Jeez, me?

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.540
Yeah, because there's nothing to pass the time.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:12.810
Sheesh...

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:28.390
You, that's no song to be singing.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:30.930
Well, it's the only one I know.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.570
Kiyoko, it's dangerous out here.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:11.460
Dad...

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:13.900
The Professor...

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:49.570
So they've escaped from us?

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.680
Withdraw.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:17.700
I see you graced us with your presence.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:24.370
Yes, dinnertime came and still my children were nowhere to be seen.

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:30.610
By the bye, might you kindly quit going around buying up shares of my company's stock?

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:34.050
Officially it registered as foreign investors making a move,

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:37.110
...but the one pulling the strings behind the scenes is you, correct?

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:41.690
I noticed early on, so I was able to buy them back, but it was a close call.

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:48.430
It would be no joke if I were to be dismissed by you and tossed out onto the street stark naked, would it?

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:52.100
Please don't bully us youngsters too much.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:58.400
Weren't you the one who bullied one of my young children first?

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:05.610
Perhaps that backfired on me.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:09.010
Please give my regards to your chairman.

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:12.350
That is, if he's still among the living of course.

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:17.060
I most certainly will.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.290
Well, until we meet again...

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:48.060
Once again, you've lost what home you had to return to.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.900
What do you intend to do about your debt?

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:54.500
I'll manage it somehow.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:57.020
With no home and no work?

00:20:57.430 --> 00:21:01.500
I'm not so softhearted as to feel pity over your situation.

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:05.740
Come back to the Providence.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.140
As for what comes next, we'll think about it there.

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:12.170
I trust that's all right with you.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:17.880
Let's go.

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:27.240
There's something creepy about those kids.

00:23:27.350 --> 00:23:29.110
Gloomy, I guess you'd call her.

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:31.690
That goes for that girl Kiyoko too though.

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:35.160
That girl isn't, by any chance, the same breed as those kids from just now?

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:36.990
If so, then she really is unfortunate.

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:39.960
I'm surprised they can stand to be alive and not kill themselves.
